OL,3,GNEWSADog lost on mountain found three
OL,4,Aweeks later
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dog that went missing during a Lake
OL,7,FDistrict walk on Helvellyn three weeks
OL,8,Fago has been found.
OL,10,FThe pet, called Teddy, disappeared on 2
OL,11,FAugust, prompting a search by
OL,12,Fvolunteers from Keswick Mountain Rescue
OL,13,FTeam and others.
OL,15,FIt was found stuck at Dry Gill on
OL,16,FFriday after one of the search party
OL,17,Fheard barking.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
