OL,5,
OL,6,FDue to the dangerous location, a
OL,7,Fmountain rescue team was called to help
OL,8,Fbring the dog to safety, before it was
OL,9,Freturned to the "relieved" owner about
OL,10,Fthree hours later and taken to a vet.
